pendency on RHAISTRAT-7164 delivery timing; this branch exists only if that dependency lands in time for RHOAI 3.5.\n- Epic size: ~1.5-2 sprints (qualitative — the strategy's effort arithmetic is unavailable); kept whole because provisioning and provider wiring for one approach form a single logical change over the same code paths. Re-split trigger: lifecycle-management work exceeds its design estimate by more than ~50%.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":104933,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bcdcfbfb0101f62c","agent_id":"a064da097f30cb08b","session_id":"172d32aa-435a-4a07-8b59-185510da7cc9","uuid":"5f1a01d0-20cd-4ab1-9d55-6004d7623e43","timestamp":"2026-10-26T22:35:38.364Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8004"}
