e functional level the decision specifies.\n43\t- Align with the commonly-used vector DB providers supported by the OGX vector I/O provider surface (pgvector, Milvus, Qdrant backends).\n44\t- User documentation for the migration path, covering the steps for at least the providers identified in the decision.\n45\t\n46\t## Acceptance Criteria\n47\t\n48\t- The affirmed migration form works end to end for a representative playground document set.\n49\t- Documentation covers the migration steps for the commonly-used providers identified in the decision, with no undocumented steps.\n50\t- The documented steps are validated against the delivered default-store capability (technical accuracy review against the implementation).\n51\t\n52\t## HLR Traceability\n53\t\n54\t- REQ-11: migration path from the default vector store to a production-grade vector database.\n55\t\n56\t## Risks / Notes\n57\t\n58\t- Scope is conditional on the migration-path decision; the decision record is the authoritative specification of the migration form.\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-99a250d43d96258d","agent_id":"a46add88d99ec933a","session_id":"172d32aa-435a-4a07-8b59-185510da7cc9","uuid":"57826d60-b008-4992-a91f-cc9dad98b9b8","timestamp":"2026-10-26T22:39:00.565Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-91bdc844296022d8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8004 decomposition"}
