components.\n201\t- **OGX distribution is passive** (no code change): the remote PGVector vector I/O\n202\t  backend already exists — corroborated by\n203\t  `.context/architecture-context/architecture/rhoai-3.6-ea.1/ogx-distribution.md`\n204\t  (vector I/O through Milvus, PGVector, or Qdrant backends; inline providers stripped\n205\t  from the distribution build). Provider behavior is validated as acceptance criteria on\n206\t  the delivery branches.\n207\t- **Team assignments** (Gen AI Studio for all epics) are inferred from the Staff Engineer\n208\t  Input because the Impacted Teams table is unavailable (Health Warning #1).\n209\t\n210\t## Conditional Branches\n211\t\n212\t- **E001 (go/no-go) outcomes:** A — RHAISTRAT-7164 lands in time → operator-based\n213\t  self-provisioning (BRANCH-A-E006); B — operator layer slips → BFF-managed provisioning\n214\t  (BRANCH-B-E006, the preferred alternative per SE input); C — operator layer slips and\n215\t  BFF-managed is ruled out → customer-provided PostgreSQL (BRANCH-C-E006). Exactly one\n216\t  branch is implemented.\n217\t- **E003 (migration path) outcomes:** A — migration path affirmed → BRANCH-A-E007;\n218\t  not affirmed → no epic (positioning guidance only, folded into the selected delivery\n219\t  branch's documentation scope).\n220\t- Branch epics are not standalone Jira issues; each branch's epics attach to the gating\n221\t  Investigation as a plan document. Branch epics are excluded from the main-plan\n222\t  critical path. `epic_count` counts all epics including branches (9); main-plan epics:\n223\t  5; main-plan critical path length: 2.\n224\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6e723cc7b26cd0d","agent_id":"aa8f64a754387b1a3","session_id":"172d32aa-435a-4a07-8b59-185510da7cc9","uuid":"3ae5edb3-f3e3-4530-93e2-7b1ae442a456","timestamp":"2026-10-26T22:46:11.294Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9cfde89d0ad8b9aa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"